[
    {
        "content": "<p>I submitted a few bugs on <code>IO.Process.output</code> and <code>IO.Process.run</code> (Bugs <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/14000\">lean4#14000</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/14001\">lean4#14001</a>, and <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/14003\">lean4#14003</a>). I was going to submit an RFC for a refactoring that would<br>\nhelp solve these, but there was a suggestion of a chat first.</p>\n<p>The below is a variant of <code>IO.Process.output</code> that works on <code>ByteArray</code> instead<br>\nof <code>String</code>. In order to solve Bug <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/14000\">lean4#14000</a>, I made writing to stdin <br>\nas part of a task.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO.Process.BinOutput</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exitCode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UInt32</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteArray</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">stderr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteArray</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO.Process.binOutput</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO.Process.SpawnArgs</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteArray</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO.Process.BinOutput</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">child</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stdin</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">child</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">spawn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">piped</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stderr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">piped</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">piped</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">})</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">takeStdin</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO.asTask</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">stdin.write</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">stdin.flush</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Task.Priority.dedicated</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">child</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">else</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">spawn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">piped</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stderr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">piped</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">null</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO.asTask</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">child.stdout.readBinToEnd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Task.Priority.dedicated</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stderr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">child.stderr.readBinToEnd</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exitCode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">child.wait</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO.ofExcept</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout.get</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exitCode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exitCode</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stderr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stderr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>After this is added, I can make  <code>IO.Process.output</code> call this (solving <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/14001\">lean4#14001</a>) and <code>IO.process.run</code> call this (solving <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/14003\">lean4#14003</a>).</p>\n<p>Should I just submit a pull request?</p>",
        "id": 602004540,
        "sender_full_name": "Martin Zinkevich",
        "timestamp": 1781149907
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thank you for the reports. This isn't a great fit for a pull request because how to best address these issues will need to be considered in the context of a larger upcoming refactor. Your reports will be taken into consideration when we  get to that refactor (which will likely happen sometime in the next few months).</p>",
        "id": 602052289,
        "sender_full_name": "Julia Markus Himmel",
        "timestamp": 1781163608
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I have heard of a libuv refactor (<a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/13638\">lean4#13638</a>). Is this the large upcoming refactor are you referring to? </p>\n<p>Thank you for your prompt response. In the meantime, I will simply use these methods in an external library. For those who come to this dealing with a similar problem, this is a way to solve the rest of the problem in<br>\nan external library (when added to the code above).</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/-- Binary variant of IO.Process.run -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binRun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpawnArgs</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteArray</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ByteArray</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binOutput</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binOutput</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binOutput</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exitCode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">!=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">throw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">userError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Process exited with code {binOutput.exitCode}.\"</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binOutput</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Drop-in replacement of IO.Process.run -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">altRun</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpawnArgs</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binInput?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input?</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toUTF8</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binStdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binRun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binInput?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">fromUTF8?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binStdout</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">throw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">userError</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"stdout had non-UTF-8 data.\"</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stdout</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Drop-in replacement of IO.Process.output -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">altOutput</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SpawnArgs</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">input?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Output</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binInput?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">input?</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toUTF8</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binOutput</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IO</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Process</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binOutput</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">binInput?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">binOutput</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toOutput</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
